<title>POLAND: KETY 10 PCT PLUNGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</title>
<headline>KETY 10 PCT PLUNGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Kety SA fell 10 percent to 180 zlotys in active trade but analysts said it was difficult to explain the extent of the fall.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't think of any fundamental reasons which would explain the plunge -- it seems somebody wants to close their position on Kety and sell the shares, but it's difficult to say why,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Kety's turnover was at 2.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
